# IT 140 Module Four Assignment
# Higher/Lower Game Pseudocode Template
#
# Complete the TODO prompts below with your own pseudocode.
# Keep this file in .pseudo format for submission.
#
# Use clear indentation to show decisions and repeated behavior.
# Your finished pseudocode should address every requirement in the
# current Module Four Assignment Guidelines and Rubric.

START hilow_game

    # Establish a valid guessing range.
        Ask the player to enter the lowest number they want to use.
    Ask the player to enter the highest number they want to use.

    Check to make sure the lowest number is smaller than the highest number.
    If the lowest number is not smaller than the highest number,
        tell the player that the lower number must be less than the upper number.
        ask the player to enter both numbers again.
    Keep checking until the lower number is smaller than the upper number.
    # Establish the number the player is trying to guess.
        Choose a random number between the lowest and highest numbers.

    # Play the game.
        Ask the player to guess a number between the lowest and highest numbers.

    Check to make sure the guess is within the allowed range.
    If the guess is outside of the allowed range,
        tell the player that the guess must be between the lowest and highest numbers.
        ask the player to enter another guess.
    Keep checking until the player enters a valid guess.

    Keep the game going until the player guesses the correct number.

        If the player's guess is lower than the chosen number,
            tell the player that the number is higher.

        If the player's guess is higher than the chosen number,
            tell the player that the number is lower.

        If the player's guess matches the chosen number,
            tell the player that they got it right.

        If the player has not guessed the correct number,
            ask the player to guess again.

            Check to make sure the new guess is within the allowed range.
            If the new guess is outside of the allowed range,
                tell the player to enter a number between the lowest and highest numbers.
                ask the player for another guess.
            Keep checking until the player enters a valid guess.
END hilow_game

